{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/859b102fe542b49b3caccbd37a33c577.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longing, ambition, vengeance. Everyone has a reason to enter the Screamer tournament, and no one\u2019s backing down. Join the competition and race side by side with fearless drivers, ready to push past every limit to chase what they believe in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a43368463adddc9a2fdd8adc0f9fb0b6.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a43368463adddc9a2fdd8adc0f9fb0b6.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a5f21bdb256a07e1a2d1654605ea53a9.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five teams. Five reasons to risk it all \u2013 on and off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers, scientists, criminals, superstars, and ruthless magnates. Different paths now converging on a single focal point: the Screamer tournament. Led by a mysterious master, this merciless competition will be the key to each participant\u2019s personal goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your driver wisely: each one steers a vehicle that mirrors their style, with a bespoke design and a unique ability that gives them an edge in this brutal showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/479af97c1faa7498125c9a59d9a8de65.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/479af97c1faa7498125c9a59d9a8de65.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5acece9bba394701d5112cddfd975811.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage of the most lethal races, this arcade racing game plunges you into a futuristic universe brimming with 90s anime vibes. Step into a neon-lit world and speed across tracks where the adrenaline is always high! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5a0551646573f9fb6e46ccfda809f811.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=838 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5a0551646573f9fb6e46ccfda809f811.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/0bb9642c3e0b0115cc64c71edc3e967e.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious tech that changed racing forever: the ECHO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to it, cars don\u2019t just race \u2013 they fight! Push them past the edge again and again. Juggle between Boost, Strike, and Shield to stay in the lead, unleashing blistering bursts of speed and well-placed hits to knock your rivals off the track. And once Overdrive kicks in, it\u2019s full-throttle chaos: no mercy, no brakes, and no room for anyone in your path. Master the ECHO power and you\u2019ll become a real Screamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a95a9b9590f9c79f027ae8bc72dbf728.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=838 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a95a9b9590f9c79f027ae8bc72dbf728.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/e22ef674d3660b215bb8397ea8097457.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Screamer needs to be ready for any kind of challenge, and being the fastest isn\u2019t always enough. Among the various game modes, you\u2019ll find Team Races where crossing the finish line is just as important as taking down your opponents, while in others, the key is staying in Overdrive for as long as possible. Prove you\u2019re the best no matter what challenge stands in your way, as well as online and in split-screen mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5621315d6ab55fcc74211a028f9f7c18.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5621315d6ab55fcc74211a028f9f7c18.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814990?t=1770818554","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/332c6840c18d73e353b4a41dc8fbda15ef5dc3a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770818554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/274907193f54622df6f23ef2067702a570a215ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770818554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/274907193f54622df6f23ef2067702a570a215ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770818554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not approriate for all ages. It contains General Mature Content, and may include strong language and violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/bbcfb14953d837a42d0d0a5e08e20567.avif?t=1770818554\" width=1170 height=720 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/2944d90da118d68dce800f3d3163463e.avif?t=1770818554\" width=1170 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start early, stay ahead, and try to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-purchase the <strong>Digital Deluxe Edition</strong> and you'll get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The full game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Digital Deluxe Upgrade, with unique customizations for the Screamers' vehicles*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Chromed Style Pack, with chromed liveries for the Screamers' vehicles*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Iridescent Style Pack, with iridescent liveries for the Screamers' vehicles*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three days of early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Customizations will be available once the vehicle is acquired in-game and can be used anywhere except in Tournament mode.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/859b102fe542b49b3caccbd37a33c577.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longing, ambition, vengeance. Everyone has a reason to enter the Screamer tournament, and no one\u2019s backing down. Join the competition and race side by side with fearless drivers, ready to push past every limit to chase what they believe in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a43368463adddc9a2fdd8adc0f9fb0b6.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a43368463adddc9a2fdd8adc0f9fb0b6.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a5f21bdb256a07e1a2d1654605ea53a9.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five teams. Five reasons to risk it all \u2013 on and off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers, scientists, criminals, superstars, and ruthless magnates. Different paths now converging on a single focal point: the Screamer tournament. Led by a mysterious master, this merciless competition will be the key to each participant\u2019s personal goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your driver wisely: each one steers a vehicle that mirrors their style, with a bespoke design and a unique ability that gives them an edge in this brutal showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/479af97c1faa7498125c9a59d9a8de65.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/479af97c1faa7498125c9a59d9a8de65.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5acece9bba394701d5112cddfd975811.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage of the most lethal races, this arcade racing game plunges you into a futuristic universe brimming with 90s anime vibes. Step into a neon-lit world and speed across tracks where the adrenaline is always high! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5a0551646573f9fb6e46ccfda809f811.poster.avif?t=1770818554\" width=838 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/5a0551646573f9fb6e46ccfda809f811.webm?t=1770818554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/0bb9642c3e0b0115cc64c71edc3e967e.avif?t=1770818554\" width=839 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious tech that changed racing forever: the ECHO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to it, cars don\u2019t just race \u2013 they fight! Push them past the edge again and again. Juggle between Boost, Strike, and Shield to stay in the lead, unleashing blistering bursts of speed and well-placed hits to knock your rivals off the track. And once Overdrive kicks in, it\u2019s full-throttle chaos: no mercy, no brakes, and no room for anyone in your path. Master the ECHO power and you\u2019ll become a real Screamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814990/extras/a95a9b9590f9c79f027ae8bc72dbf